"Models loaded" = "Samfuran da aka loda";
"Model memory" = "Ƙwaƙwalwar samfuri";
"Across all cores" = "A duk sassan sarrafawa";
"%@ of RAM" = "%@ na RAM";
"Updates every 2 seconds and counts LokalBot and its helpers. External Ollama and Apple Intelligence models aren't counted." = "Yana sabuntawa kowane daƙiƙa 2 kuma yana ƙidaya LokalBot da masu taimakonsa. Ba a ƙidaya samfuran Ollama na waje da Apple Intelligence ba.";
"Diagnostics include logs, health reports, settings without secrets, and library counts. Never meeting audio, transcripts, notes, or screenshots." = "Bayanan gano matsala sun haɗa kundin aiki, rahoton lafiya, saituna ba tare da sirri ba, da adadin ɗakin ajiya. Ba su haɗa sautin taro, rubutun magana, bayanin kula, ko hoton allo ba.";
"Autocomplete server" = "Sabar kammalawa kai tsaye";
"Think's server" = "Sabar Tunani";
"Another server" = "Wata sabar";
"Request type" = "Nau'in buƙata";
"Text completion" = "Kammala rubutu";
"Server URL" = "URL na sabar";
"API key" = "Maɓallin API";
"Optional" = "Na zaɓi";
"Same as Think (%@)" = "Daida da Tunani (%@)";
"Leave empty to use Think's model, or name a smaller one for faster suggestions." = "Bar shi babu komai don amfani da samfurin Tunani, ko sanya sunan ƙarami don shawarwari masu sauri.";
"Any OpenAI-compatible /v1 URL, such as OpenRouter, llama-server, LM Studio, or Ollama." = "Kowane URL na /v1 mai dacewa da OpenAI, kamar OpenRouter, llama-server, LM Studio, ko Ollama.";
"Automatic picks text completion or chat for the server." = "Kai tsaye yana zaɓar kammala rubutu ko hira don sabar.";
"Runs on this Mac. What you type stays here." = "Yana gudana a wannan Mac. Abin da ka rubuta yana nan.";
"Use HTTPS for a server outside your network or tailnet." = "Yi amfani da HTTPS don sabar da ke wajen hanyar sadarwarka ko tailnet.";
"Send typing to %@" = "Aika rubutawa zuwa %@";
"What you type goes to this server as you type, with the context you turn on under Settings → Writing." = "Abin da kake rubutawa yana zuwa wannan sabar yayin rubutawa, tare da mahallin da ka kunna a Saituna → Rubutu.";
"Unencrypted HTTP: use it only on your own network or tailnet." = "HTTP mara ɓoyewa: yi amfani da shi kawai a hanyar sadarwarka ko tailnet.";
"The autocomplete server URL must start with http:// or https://." = "URL na sabar kammalawa kai tsaye dole ya fara da http:// ko https://.";
"Autocomplete also sends what you type, with the context you turn on under Writing, to %@." = "Kammalawa kai tsaye ma tana aika abin da kake rubutawa, tare da mahallin da ka kunna a Rubutu, zuwa %@.";
"Context you turn on here is sent to %@ with what you type." = "Ana aika mahallin da ka kunna nan zuwa %@ tare da abin da kake rubutawa.";
"The model answered with no text." = "Samfurin ya amsa ba tare da rubutu ba.";
"The model repeated text it was given, so its answer is hidden." = "Samfurin ya maimaita rubutun da aka ba shi, saboda haka an ɓoye amsarsa.";
"The answer did not fit at the cursor, so it is hidden." = "Amsar ba ta dace da wurin siginan kwamfuta ba, saboda haka an ɓoye ta.";
"The model was unsure of the next word, so it suggested nothing." = "Samfurin bai tabbatar da kalma ta gaba ba, saboda haka bai ba da shawarar komai ba.";
